WEBVTT

00:13:59.236 --> 00:14:00.396
in your backyard.

00:14:00.796 --> 00:14:02.876
Screen your rainwater tanks.

00:14:02.876 --> 00:14:04.596
Clean your gutters and your drains,

00:14:04.636 --> 00:14:07.236
reduce that standing water
that mosquitoes love so much

00:14:07.236 --> 00:14:08.396
around our homes.

00:14:09.596 --> 00:14:11.556
Secondly,

00:14:11.556 --> 00:14:13.716
insect repellents are a safe
and effective way

00:14:13.756 --> 00:14:15.356
to avoid mosquito bites.

00:14:15.396 --> 00:14:17.076
When you're choosing a formulation

00:14:17.116 --> 00:14:19.116
from the local pharmacy
or the supermarket,

00:14:19.156 --> 00:14:21.596
make sure you apply it
as a nice, even coat

00:14:21.636 --> 00:14:23.796
over all exposed areas of skin.

00:14:24.596 --> 00:14:26.556
Don't put it on like perfume.

00:14:26.596 --> 00:14:29.196
A dab here or there
is not going to provide protection.

00:14:29.236 --> 00:14:32.476
Unless you've got complete cover,
those mosquitoes will find a way